    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Type</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/242890de7794d587d2ed3b2f2ee438e6.poster.avif?t=1749336127\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/242890de7794d587d2ed3b2f2ee438e6.webm?t=1749336127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/242890de7794d587d2ed3b2f2ee438e6.mp4?t=1749336127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plan</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/b23ced7b5b11bd3d9ed2d7dde6e6377e.poster.avif?t=1749336127\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/b23ced7b5b11bd3d9ed2d7dde6e6377e.webm?t=1749336127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/b23ced7b5b11bd3d9ed2d7dde6e6377e.mp4?t=1749336127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Type Again</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/757dfa82b31f20befe7fb2a3134ec9da.poster.avif?t=1749336127\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/757dfa82b31f20befe7fb2a3134ec9da.webm?t=1749336127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/757dfa82b31f20befe7fb2a3134ec9da.mp4?t=1749336127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Give Her A Good Night's Sleep</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/dd8feb0721db4184199d1fdbeb44a93d.avif?t=1749336127\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision-based typing game where accuracy and speed matter. The more typos you commit or words you miss, the more her stress builds up to the point she can\u2019t sleep anymore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exhaustive vocabulary of everyday words for you to type on to help build up your muscle memory. At least 1000 words making up of 3 to 10 characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty settings for any skill level, so you can play at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night, pick modifiers to shape your run, ensuring every session feels fresh and fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing lo-fi soundtrack to serenade you as you type.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the story of an overworked, underappreciated and sleep-deprived office lady as she tries out a new sleeping technique to fix her abysmal sleeping habit.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Type</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/242890de7794d587d2ed3b2f2ee438e6.poster.avif?t=1749336127\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/242890de7794d587d2ed3b2f2ee438e6.webm?t=1749336127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/242890de7794d587d2ed3b2f2ee438e6.mp4?t=1749336127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plan</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/b23ced7b5b11bd3d9ed2d7dde6e6377e.poster.avif?t=1749336127\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/b23ced7b5b11bd3d9ed2d7dde6e6377e.webm?t=1749336127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/b23ced7b5b11bd3d9ed2d7dde6e6377e.mp4?t=1749336127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Type Again</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/757dfa82b31f20befe7fb2a3134ec9da.poster.avif?t=1749336127\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/757dfa82b31f20befe7fb2a3134ec9da.webm?t=1749336127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/757dfa82b31f20befe7fb2a3134ec9da.mp4?t=1749336127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Give Her A Good Night's Sleep</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/dd8feb0721db4184199d1fdbeb44a93d.avif?t=1749336127\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision-based typing game where accuracy and speed matter. The more typos you commit or words you miss, the more her stress builds up to the point she can\u2019t sleep anymore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exhaustive vocabulary of everyday words for you to type on to help build up your muscle memory. At least 1000 words making up of 3 to 10 characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty settings for any skill level, so you can play at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night, pick modifiers to shape your run, ensuring every session feels fresh and fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing lo-fi soundtrack to serenade you as you type.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the story of an overworked, underappreciated and sleep-deprived office lady as she tries out a new sleeping technique to fix her abysmal sleeping habit.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Type Her to Sleep is a lofi cozy typing game where your goal is to help our heroine get a good night\u2019s sleep by typing out her thoughts before they escape. Enjoy relaxing tunes, comforting visuals and a dynamic modifier system that ensures every run is unique.",
